WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
[Instrumental music, no narration] Opening: AI Accounting Assistant, intelligent support for accounting reconciliation. On-screen text is in Portuguese.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
The reconciliation home screen opens the assistant in the user's context, with shortcuts by topic.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
The assistant highlights the approval queue. A fictional reconciliation sheet is opened for review.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
The sheet shows balances, journal entries and demo accounting data.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
In the assistant panel, the sheet diagnosis brings together the step deadline, the month-over-month balance change and open items.

00:23.000 --> 00:31.870
The pre-approval checklist checks balances, attachments, open items and period, then suggests next steps. The final decision stays with the user.

00:31.870 --> 00:35.000
Closing: from question to evidence, from evidence to the next step. Demo with fictional data.
